{
  "abstract": "This paper replaces the former claim that one projection obstruction makes the observed form of physics inevitable. It gives a typed dependency map separating representative selection, exact decoding, autonomous descent, effective merger, measure-dependent stochastic reduction, locality under compatible compression, fixed-point robustness and physical realization. Born weights, complex Hilbert structure, complete QFT reconstruction, gravitational normalization, entropy and a physical arrow of time remain independent theorem targets.",
